   "text": "Arts University of Bournemouth - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nArts University of Bournemouth\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nArts University Bournemouth (AUB) is a further and higher education university based in Poole, Dorset, United Kingdom, specialising in art, performance, design, and media. The Arts University Bournemouth is set in one the UK’s most beautiful award-winning natural locations; boasting spectacular gardens, beaches, forests and a Jurassic coastline. AUB was awarded the top specialist arts and design university in the UK (Good University Guide 2021). It is one of only fifteen higher education institutions in the UK devoted solely to the study of art, design and media. University was awarded Gold in Teaching Excellence Framework (TEF 2020).\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n26/03/2026 10:16\nby Gunia Beniwal\nCreated\n26/03/2026 10:16\nby Gunia Beniwal\nType\nUniversity\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nYearly Fees\nMax: £23,190.00\nMin: £17,764.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n11%\n418 of 3,800 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPublic\nProvider\nDirect QS\nFounded Year\n1880\nCampus(es)\nPoole\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nExcluded Countries\nAfghanistan, Cameroon, Sudan\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n20/05/2022\nContract End Date\n01/01/2036\nContract Entity\nQSSA Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nAvailable for International Students.\nScholarship Offered\nAvailable for international students.\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=R94rHX7kdUE\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\n-",
